#: f2ad48d29433457e8391908f926626be
msgid "输出模块"
msgstr "Output Modules"

#: e39d3e8d669a47b4b5c7d2091504fd66
msgid "基于边特征计算原子受力的输出模块。"
msgstr "An output module that calculates atomic forces based on edge features."

#: 73b0cc23baa04909bc927a741647651e
msgid ""
"该模块使用一个密集回归模型（`denseRegression`）来处理每条边的特征， 并将其预测的标量值沿着边的方向矢量投影，从而得到力矢量。 "
"最后，将所有作用到同一个原子上的力矢量进行汇总（scatter-add），得到每个原子的总受力。"
msgstr "This module uses a dense regression model (`denseRegression`) to process the features of each edge and projects the predicted scalar value along the edge's direction vector to obtain the force vector. Finally, all force vectors acting on the same atom are summed up (scatter-add) to get the total force for each atom."

